BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sons
DTSTART:20250524T041500Z
DTEND:20250524T060500Z
DTSTAMP:20250524T041500Z
UID:9CthxJbWii
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nWriter/director Gustav Möller (S
 IFF 2018’s The Guilty) returns to the Fest with another pulse-pounding a
 nd morally gray thriller\, as a prison guard learns that a young man from 
 her past has just been transferred to her post.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/fe
 stival/sons\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Downtown (Sun 25 May\, 
 1:45 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dead Lover
DTSTART:20250524T065900Z
DTEND:20250524T083400Z
DTSTAMP:20250524T065900Z
UID:xMRwlFy0kJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nGrace Glowicki (Tito\, SIFF 2021
 ’s Strawberry Mansion) writes\, directs\, and gives a barkingly daring l
 ead performance in this bizarre\, performance art-coded\, gender-bending l
 o-fi Frankenstein comedy about a lonely gravedigger who will do anything t
 o build the perfect man. SXSW NEON Auteur Award winner. Get in the right h
 eadspace for this absolute ride of a film with a trivia giveaway hosted by
  BoneBat Comedy of Horrors Film Fest before the May 23 screening. Go even 
 deeper into the satire and weird vibes at the May 24 screening with a tick
 et giveaway to Annex Theatre’s upcoming production of "Alice in Arabiala
 nd."\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/dead-lover\n\nAlso playing at:\n  
 • AMC Pacific Place 11 (Sat 24 May\, 1:45 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
